|combos=* Vul Tazaenne + [[Red Leader]] in [[Red 1]]/Gold [[Red Leader{{!}}Leader]] in [[Gold 1]] + 2 Landing Claws + [[Kiffex (Jabba's Palace){{!}}Kiffex]] = The coolness of this is it's simplicity. This is not a 6 card combo, but a situation that you can prepare for. You will have the ability to drain for two at [[Kiffex (Jabba's Palace){{!}}Kiffex]] while keeping a safe distance from your opponent. If they decide to battle you, hide. If you draw any of these cards for destiny, they are all a two's. Also, if you control [[Kiffex (Jabba's Palace){{!}}Kiffex]] itself with the two starships, Vul will add 4 to all 4's. Not bad for a little 2 deploy character.<ref name="scomp">Players Committee [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/swccg-card-json/d4e661ec735dcb111266fbda98704f2181e1cfab/Light.json complete card data], entry <code>6_45</code>, <code>combo</code> field. Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261026181118id_/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/swccg-card-json/d4e661ec735dcb111266fbda98704f2181e1cfab/Light.json Internet Archive].</ref>
